    {
      "nodeKey": "director",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "总导演·创作简报",
      "position": {
        "x": 260,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-director",
        "userInputTemplate": "输出本集唯一生产简报与岗位任务。先按‘目标—阻碍—有代价的选择—变化’明确戏剧主线，再设计观众信息路径、情绪曲线、转折和视觉策略，并写入 production_brief.delivery_spec.directorial_intent。给编剧任务设置因果升级、场景目标/冲突/转折/退出状态、行动塑造人物、潜台词和伏笔回收门禁；给分镜任务设置一镜一意图、景别/机位服务信息与情绪、可见可听描述、起止状态与时空连续性、静音/删镜检查门禁。总时长可以大于 6 秒；在交付规格中明确下游单镜默认不超过 6 秒且只做一个核心动作，但不要把计划写成已生成成品。\n【项目设定】\n{{start.projectBrief}}\n【本集需求】\n{{start.episodeBrief}}\n【总时长】{{start.durationSeconds}} 秒\n【画幅】{{start.aspectRatio}}\n【额外要求】{{start.requirements}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"production_brief\",\"tasks\",\"asset_status\",\"quality_gates\",\"next_action\"],\"properties\":{\"production_brief\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"goal\",\"delivery_spec\",\"assumptions\",\"blockers\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"goal\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"delivery_spec\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"assumptions\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"blockers\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}},\"tasks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"asset_status\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"quality_gates\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"next_action\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "writer",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "编剧·剧本包",
      "position": {
        "x": 500,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-screenwriter",
        "userInputTemplate": "读取导演简报中的 directorial_intent，把主角目标、中心阻碍、风险和有代价的选择写成由‘但是/因此’推进的纯剧本包，总时长与简报一致。每场明确进入状态、场景目标、对抗力量、失败代价、人物策略、转折和退出状态；每个节拍写可观察行动、台词/潜台词、声音与后果。关键转折必须来自人物主动选择，反转必须有前置线索，删除无状态变化且无铺垫/回收功能的场景。保持人物声音和连续性，不用旁白重复画面，不规定景别、运镜或模型提示词。\n【导演简报】\n{{director.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"script_package\"],\"properties\":{\"script_package\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"logline\",\"theme\",\"target_duration_sec\",\"assumptions\",\"blockers\",\"scenes\",\"continuity_constraints\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"logline\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"theme\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"target_duration_sec\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0},\"assumptions\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"blockers\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"scenes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"continuity_constraints\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "char_design",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "人物设定",
      "position": {
        "x": 740,
        "y": 220
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-character-designer",
        "userInputTemplate": "只建立本集实际出场角色的视觉身份与版本系统。把故事功能转换成剪影、比例、脸部识别点、发型、服装层级、材质、配色、道具和表演边界；明确不可变身份、阶段 variant、逐镜状态、适用范围与禁继承项。多人必须可从剪影/配色区分，设计复杂度必须支持跨视角稳定生成。不得引入其他项目角色或调用图片工具。\n【项目设定】\n{{start.projectBrief}}\n【剧本】\n{{writer.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"character_bible\"],\"properties\":{\"character_bible\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"characters\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"characters\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"character_id\",\"name\",\"version\",\"story_function\",\"identity_invariants\",\"variants\",\"expression_range\",\"pose_constraints\",\"continuity_rules\",\"generation_description\",\"open_questions\"],\"properties\":{\"character_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"version\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"story_function\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"identity_invariants\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"variants\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"expression_range\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"pose_constraints\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"continuity_rules\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"generation_description\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"open_questions\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "scene_design",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "场景设定",
      "position": {
        "x": 740,
        "y": 580
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-scene-designer",
        "userInputTemplate": "只建立本集实际场景的空间母版与状态版本。根据剧情功能写清区域、出入口、高低关系、永久地标、尺度、行动/遮挡/危险区、主轴线、可用机位、材质和物理光源；场景必须支持剧本动作并能跨机位辨认。场景母版保持无人，不得混入其他项目地点或调用图片工具。\n【项目设定】\n{{start.projectBrief}}\n【剧本】\n{{writer.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scene_bible\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_bible\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"scenes\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"scenes\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scene_id\",\"name\",\"version\",\"story_usage\",\"layout\",\"materials\",\"palette\",\"lighting\",\"time_variants\",\"camera_positions\",\"continuity_rules\",\"generation_description\",\"open_questions\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"version\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"story_usage\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"materials\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"palette\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"lighting\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"time_variants\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"camera_positions\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"continuity_rules\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"generation_description\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"open_questions\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
