    {
      "nodeKey": "storyboard",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "独立分镜",
      "position": {
        "x": 980,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-storyboard",
        "userInputTemplate": "把导演意图和剧本状态变化转换为镜头因果。先拆节拍；每镜写清唯一叙事意图、观众信息变化、目标情绪，并说明景别、机位、构图和运镜如何服务它。每镜绑定 beat_id、角色版本、场景与道具 ID，分别描述可见主体动作和摄影机运动，明确声音、转场、生成风险及起止状态；守住轴线、视线、画面方向、人物/道具位置和动作连续性。执行静音、删镜、连续性、生成性与总时长检查。当前视频生成链默认单镜不超过 6 秒且只做一个核心动作，超出时拆镜并保持总时长；不得改写核心剧情和对白。\n【剧本】\n{{writer.output}}\n【人物设定】\n{{char_design.output}}\n【场景设定】\n{{scene_design.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"storyboard\"],\"properties\":{\"storyboard\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"aspect_ratio\",\"total_duration_sec\",\"shots\",\"duration_check\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"aspect_ratio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"total_duration_sec\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0},\"shots\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"shot_id\",\"scene_id\",\"beat_id\",\"duration_sec\",\"narrative_intent\",\"information_change\",\"emotion_target\",\"shot_size\",\"camera_angle\",\"composition\",\"subject_action\",\"camera_motion\",\"start_state\",\"end_state\",\"character_refs\",\"scene_ref\",\"prop_refs\",\"dialogue\",\"audio\",\"transition\",\"continuity_checks\",\"generation_risks\"],\"properties\":{\"shot_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"scene_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"beat_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"narrative_intent\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"information_change\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"emotion_target\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"duration_sec\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"exclusiveMinimum\":0,\"maximum\":6},\"shot_size\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"camera_angle\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"composition\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"subject_action\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"camera_motion\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_state\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"end_state\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"character_refs\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"scene_ref\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"prop_refs\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"dialogue\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"audio\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"transition\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"continuity_checks\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"generation_risks\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}},\"duration_check\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeKey": "vfx_action",
      "type": "agent",
      "name": "动作与特效设计",
      "position": {
        "x": 1220,
        "y": 400
      },
      "config": {
        "employeeKey": "comic-vfx-designer",
        "userInputTemplate": "逐镜把动作拆成预备/重心转移、发力、路径、接触或转折、受力反馈、结果和恢复，分开记录人物、道具、环境与摄影机轨迹，并让 continuity_in/out 对应分镜起止状态。特效仅在有剧情来源时按 source/interaction/environment/residual 分层，写清时序、遮挡和消散；普通镜头允许为空。指出具体生成风险与拆镜建议，不改剧情、shot_id 或强加战斗光效。\n【分镜】\n{{storyboard.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"action_vfx_package\"],\"properties\":{\"action_vfx_package\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"project_id\",\"episode_id\",\"shots\",\"handoff_notes\"],\"properties\":{\"project_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"episode_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"shots\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"shot_id\",\"action\",\"vfx_layers\",\"continuity_in\",\"continuity_out\",\"generation_risks\",\"split_recommendation\"],\"properties\":{\"shot_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"action\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"vfx_layers\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"continuity_in\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"continuity_out\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"generation_risks\":{\"type\":\"array\"},\"split_recommendation\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"handoff_notes\":{\"type\":\"array\"}}}}}"
