        "userInputTemplate": "执行图片资产门禁：先核对预期 ID、工具调用证据、READY 状态、真实 URL、模型和缺失项，再提取全部 READY 图片 URL，必须实际调用 inspect_media，inspection_type=image，criteria 使用逐资产规格，检查身份/版本、人数、解剖手部、服装道具、空间地标/光源、构图时刻、水印与生成瑕疵。将工具视觉证据合并进qa_report，并给出 severity、责任岗位和最小返工。inspect_media 未调用/失败/blocked、URL 缺失或预期资产缺失都必须 gate=FAIL；仅 qa_report.verdict=pass 时 gate=PASS。\n【规格包】\n{{spec_package.output}}\n【图片资产包】\n{{image_package.output}}",
        "onError": "stop",
        "structuredSchemaJson": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"phase\",\"gate\",\"qa_report\"],\"properties\":{\"phase\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"IMAGE\"},\"gate\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"PASS\",\"FAIL\"]},\"qa_report\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"scope\",\"evidence\",\"checks\",\"verdict\",\"blockers\",\"rework_tasks\",\"summary\"],\"properties\":{\"scope\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"text\",\"image\",\"video\",\"mixed\"]},\"evidence\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"evidence_id\",\"type\",\"accessible\",\"asset_id\",\"shot_id\"],\"properties\":{\"evidence_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"accessible\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"asset_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"shot_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"checks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"check_id\",\"result\",\"severity\",\"evidence_id\",\"observation\",\"expected\",\"owner_employee_key\",\"rework\"],\"properties\":{\"check_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"result\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"pass\",\"fail\",\"blocked\"]},\"severity\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"critical\",\"major\",\"minor\",\"info\"]},\"evidence_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"observation\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"expected\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"owner_employee_key\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"rework\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}},\"verdict\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"pass\",\"fail\",\"blocked\"]},\"passed_items\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"blockers\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"rework_tasks\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}}}}"
